  "resumeVariants": {
    "_description": "Each job is assigned ONE variant by scripts/greenhouse-filter.cjs (title terms weigh 3, sector hits weigh 1; the variant listed first wins a tie; no match -> 'base'). The six variants are the six final one-page resumes. A variant changes EMPHASIS, ORDER and WHICH TRUE BULLETS are used - never the underlying facts. The bullet bank (data/resume-bank/bank.json, git-ignored) holds every true bullet; `node scripts/resume-bank.cjs render <variant>` rebuilds a variant. The finished .docx files live in the local resumes/ folder (git-ignored). For a title no variant covers ('base'), the tailor-resume skill researches the title and posting first, picks the nearest variant, then adjusts.",
    "base": {
      "label": "No clear match - research the title first",
      "use": "Unseen or generic title. tailor-resume Step 2 researches the role and picks the closest variant; user confirms; the choice is saved with scripts/learn-title.cjs."
    },
